<item type="0">
<value>24100103</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：调模电眼失败


警报说明：
1.自动调模过程中，首次调模进之后，检测到“调模电眼”在4s内无信号变化。


排除方法：
1.进入面板IO界面查看“调模电眼”输入是否正常，调模电眼传感器安装位置是否偏离感应齿轮或电眼损坏。
查看方法提示：如下图将原接线路脱开，用一根导线将对应的输入点端口与HCOM相连，再断开，查看对应编号指示是否变化。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">M.H.Adj.Sensor Fail.


Description：
1. During the process of automatic mold adjustment, no signal change is detected in the mold adjustment electric eye in 4 seconds after the mold is adjusted forward for the first time.


Troubleshooting：
1.Enter I/O interface to check input Mold ADJ Electric Eye, if the electric eye sensor is not installed near the sensor gear, and if the electric eye is damaged. 
Note: See page 3 for the checking method.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
