<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>29100101</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：安全门未关


警报说明：
1.安全门处于打开的状态。

排除方法：
1. 关上安全门，在面板上按主画面→换页→F6→进入IO输入界面，查看“安全门关”和“安全门关#2”输入是有效；

2. 若输入无效请按以下方法排查：
查看方法提示：如下图将原接线路脱开，用一根导线将对应的输入点端口与HCOM相连，再断开，查看对应编号指示是否变化。

3. 如果没有指示，说明输入点已经损坏，需对输入点进行重新定义；如果指示正常，则外围电路故障，请查看线路及开关。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Please Close Door


Description：
1.The power door is open. 

Troubleshooting：
1. Close the power door. Press MAIN -&gt; NEXT PAGE -&gt; F6 to enter the IO input page. Check the input of "Power Door Close" and "Power Door Close #2";

2. If the input does not work, use the following method to troubleshoot: 
Note: Disconnect the existing wiring shown in the following figure. Use a conductor to connect the input to HCOM and then disconnect it. Check if the corresponding indicator changes in the process.

3. If not, the input is broken. The input needs to be redefined; If the indicator is normal, the outer circuit fails. Check the circuit and switch.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>29100103</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：背面安全门未关


排除方法：
1.请关好后安全门；


2.查看I/O界面“后安全门关终”输入是否正常，后安全门关终行程开关是否损坏。
查看方法提示：如下图将原接线路脱开，用一根导线将对应的输入点端口与HCOM相连，再断开，查看对应编号指示是否变化。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Pls Close Rear Door


Troubleshooting：
1.Close the power door;


2.Enter I/O interface to check input "Rear Power Door Close End" and if the close end stroke switch is damaged.
Note: See page 3 for the checking method.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
