<item type="0">
<value>29100104</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：安全门失败


警报说明：
1.两个前安全门行程检测开关状态不一致时间超过2S。


排除方法：
1.查看I/O界面“安全门关”和“安全门关#2”输入是否正常，安全门关和安全门关2#开关是否损坏。
查看方法提示：如下图将原接线路脱开，用一根导线将对应的输入点端口与HCOM相连，再断开，查看对应编号指示是否变化。

2.查看造成安全门关限位开关不同步的机械故障。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Safty Switch Fail


Description：
1.Two front power door stroke detection switches remain in different status for more than 2 seconds.


Troubleshooting：
1.Enter I/O interface to check input Power Door Close and Power Door Close #2, and if switches of Power Door Close and Power Door Close #2 are damaged. 
Note: See page 3 for the checking method.

2.Find out the mechanical failure that causes asynchronization of the power door closing limit switches.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>29100108</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：安全门检测异常


警报说明：
1.关模过程中，“液压安全检知”、“液压安全检知2”或“保护电眼”输入点被触发。


排除方法：
1.进入面板IO界面查看“液压安全检知”、“液压安全检知2”和“保护电眼”输入点，查看相应开关是否损坏；


2.查看主机“液压安全检知”、“液压安全检知2”和“保护电眼”输入点或输入信号是否异常。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Door Check Error


Description：
1.Input Hydraulic Safety Check, Hydraulic Safety Check 2 or Protective Electric Eye is triggered in the clamp closing process.


Troubleshooting：
1.Enter I/O interface to check input Hydraulic Safety Check, Hydraulic Safety Check 2 and Protective Electric Eye, and if the related switches are damaged;

2.Check input Hydraulic Safety Check, Hydraulic Safety Check 2 and Protective Electric Eye or input signals.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
