<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>31100103</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：等待机械手


警报说明：
1.机械手选择常规：
a).关模前，“机械手”输入点未被触发。


2.机械手选择欧规：
a).关模前，“关模安全”输入点未被触发。


3.机械手选择欧规且“机械手手动”输入点未被触发：
a).中子进前，“中子进安全”输入点未被触发；
b).中子退前，“中子退安全”输入点未被触发；
c).托模进前，“顶进安全”输入点未被触发；
d).托模退前，“顶退指令”输入点未被触发；
e).半自动、时间(或电眼)自动再循环开始前，“循环启动”输入点未被触发。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Waiting Robot


Description：
1.The robot is set to General: 
a).Input Robot is not triggered before the clamp is closed.


2.The robot is set to VDE: 
a).Input Close Safety is not triggered before the clamp is closed.


3.Robot is set to VDE and input Manual Robot is not triggered: 
a).Core is pushed forward and input Core ADV Safety is not triggered; 
b).Core returns and input Core RET Safety is not triggered; 
c).Ejector is pushed forward and input Ejector ADV Safety is not triggered; 
d).Ejector returns and input Ejector RET Safety is not triggered; 
e).Input Cycle Start is not triggered before the next semi-auto, time (or electric eye) cycle starts.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>32100101</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：检出电眼未到位


警报说明：
1.检出电眼未感应到成品脱落。


排除方法：
1.查看产品是否正常经过电眼区域，并被电眼检测到；


2.查看面板IO界面检出电眼输入是否有效，检出电眼是否损坏。
查看方法提示：如下图将原接线路脱开，用一根导线将对应的输入点端口与HCOM相连，再断开，查看对应编号指示是否变化。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">ChkMdAuto Pos Error


Description：
1.No falling finished product is detected by the electric eye. (The detection is only performed when auto electric eye is enabled)


Troubleshooting：
1.Check if products fall across the detection area and if they can be detected by the electric eye;

2.Check the electric eye input on the IO interface and if the electric eye is damaged. 
Note: See page 3 for the checking method.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
