<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">警报名：油温偏差


警报说明：
1.当前油温超出油温警报上下限设定值。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Oil Temp.Over


Description：
1.The current oil temperature is higher or lower than the upper or lower limit set for oil temperature alarm.</string>
